graph TB
    subgraph Repo["llm-d meta-repository: recipes, guides, images. No runtime service of its own"]
        direction TB
        subgraph Guides["guides/ - about 30 well-lit paths"]
            GuideOverlays["Guide overlays<br/>accelerator x engine x provider<br/>base, gke, ocp, cks, amd-ci"]
        end
        subgraph Recipes["guides/recipes/ - shared building blocks"]
            RouterValues["router/<br/>Helm values: EPP, Envoy/agentgateway proxy,<br/>failureMode: FailOpen, monitoring, tracing"]
            GatewayRecipes["gateway/<br/>Gateway CR per provider: istio, agentgateway,<br/>kgateway - deprecated, gke-l7, nginx, envoy-ai-gw"]
            MSBases["modelserver/<br/>Deployment, LeaderWorkerSet, DisaggregatedSet bases<br/>image pins, PodMonitors, model-cache PVC"]
            Autoscaling["autoscaling/<br/>OCP KEDA to Thanos auth bundle"]
            Observability["observability/<br/>OTel collector, Jaeger, Grafana, PrometheusRules"]
        end
        subgraph Images["docker/ and helpers/ - upstream images, not used in RHOAI"]
            CPUImg["Dockerfile.cpu<br/>vLLM v0.30.0 from source, ubuntu:25.10"]
            XPUImg["Dockerfile.xpu<br/>vllm-openai-xpu + LMCache v0.5.0"]
            RDMAImg["Dockerfile.rdma-tools<br/>CUDA 13 UBI9 diagnostics"]
            DebugPod["interactive-pod<br/>debug/benchmark shell + editor Role"]
            Snapshot["snapshot launcher<br/>GKE gVisor pod snapshots"]
        end
        Docs["docs/ and proposals/<br/>EPP HTTP/gRPC APIs, headers, InferencePool"]
    end

    Operator["Cluster operator<br/>helm install + kubectl apply -k"] -->|follows| GuideOverlays
    GuideOverlays -->|patches| MSBases
    GuideOverlays -->|uses| RouterValues
    GuideOverlays -->|uses| GatewayRecipes

    RouterValues -->|configures| RouterChart["llm-d Router Helm chart<br/>ghcr.io/llm-d/charts<br/>standalone or gateway mode"]
    RouterChart -->|deploys| EPP["EPP pod<br/>endpoint picker + Envoy sidecar"]
    RouterChart -->|creates| InferencePool["InferencePool CR<br/>inference.networking.k8s.io/v1"]
    GatewayRecipes -->|creates| GatewayCR["Gateway + HTTPRoute<br/>HTTP :80"]
    MSBases -->|renders| ModelServers["vLLM / SGLang pods<br/>:8000, decode :8200 behind sidecar"]
    MSBases -->|renders| DSet["DisaggregatedSet / LeaderWorkerSet CRs"]
    Autoscaling -->|creates| KEDAObj["ScaledObject + TriggerAuthentication"]
    Observability -->|creates| Monitors["PodMonitor / PrometheusRule"]

    GatewayCR -->|backendRef| InferencePool
    InferencePool -->|selects by llm-d.ai labels| ModelServers
    EPP -->|picks endpoint in| InferencePool
    DSet -->|owns| ModelServers
    KEDAObj -->|scales| ModelServers

    KServe["KServe LLMInferenceService<br/>RHOAI deployer"] -.->|mirrors topology, flags, ports, headers| Repo
    KServe -.->|uses RHAIIS AIPCC images instead| Images

    style CPUImg fill:#4a90e2
    style XPUImg fill:#4a90e2
